## 1. Motion Design CLI: zenray-edit-motion.mjs (27 October 2026)

Script location:
`/Users/zenray/.claude/skills/zenray-edit/scripts/zenray-edit-motion.mjs`

### List existing Motion Design projects (27 October 2026)

```bash
